# Theme

## Current implementation

- Colors: CSS variables in `src/index.css`, Tailwind utilities (`bg-background`, `text-foreground-muted`, `bg-surface`, …).
- Light on `:root`. Dark on `.dark`.
- Zustand store: `src/shared/hooks/darkmode/useThemeStore.ts`
  - `theme: 'dark' | 'light'`
  - `toggleTheme()`
  - persist key `'theme'`
  - first-load default (when unset) from `prefers-color-scheme` inside the store — this is **not** a live `system` mode
- `ThemeToggle` reads store only; no `document` writes; no `useEffect`.
- `App.tsx` toggles `document.documentElement` class `dark`.
- `index.html` has no theme script. Do not add one.

## Project standard

Do not introduce:

- `system` as a theme value
- `setTheme` / `resetTheme`
- `ThemeProvider` / theme context
- a second theme store
- theme logic outside the existing React/Zustand path

Canvas tokens: `--canvas`, `--node`, `--node-border`, `--connection`. Add roles in `index.css`, then `@theme inline`.
